WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.625
Finish Claude setup, then open
Accessibility settings from the chat.

00:00:04.625 --> 00:00:07.583
Turn on Handy AI
and return to the app.

00:00:07.583 --> 00:00:11.292
Choose Use screen-reading example
to fill in the prompt.

00:00:11.292 --> 00:00:15.083
Review the prompt.
You can edit it before you start.

00:00:15.083 --> 00:00:17.750
Use a screen you are
comfortable sharing.

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:21.750
When you are ready, tap Start,
the round button at the right.
